WEBVTT

00:34:57.735 --> 00:35:01.543
especially since there's often a stigma
associated with asking for help.

00:35:02.380 --> 00:35:04.607
CM: We also wanted to normalize that,

00:35:04.631 --> 00:35:06.356
that everyone's reaction is normal,

00:35:06.380 --> 00:35:10.948
based on their own personal circumstances
and where they come from.

00:35:10.972 --> 00:35:14.496
I think it's helping us move
our culture to a positive place

00:35:14.520 --> 00:35:17.476
and maybe lower some of that burnout.

00:35:17.500 --> 00:35:19.782
AG: South Metro created
a peer-support program

00:35:19.806 --> 00:35:21.866
for workers and their families.

00:35:21.890 --> 00:35:25.246
After a difficult call, like
a big fire or a mass shooting,

00:35:25.270 --> 00:35:28.723
first responders can opt in
to what they call "defuse sessions."

00:35:29.840 --> 00:35:34.466
That's defuse as in defusing a bomb.